WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Paid once. Processed twice?
Stripe can send the same payment message again.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
If your app reacts to both messages,
it could add the same credits twice.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
SafeStripe checks the sender and saves the update
before saying “received.”

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
Repeat the message. Keep the result.
Repeated updates keep the original saved receipt.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Real sandbox test: ten duplicate updates.
The original receipt and paid time stayed unchanged.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Handle the repeats. Keep building.
Try SafeStripe with your own Stripe test keys.
